that take points away.

00:03:41.667 --> 00:03:43.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.734 --> 00:03:47.968
This question is,
"Blonde or brunette?"

00:03:47.968 --> 00:03:49.100
-Oh.
-Oh.

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:51.100
-"This is a great question,
Jimmy.

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:52.267
Thank you, Jimmy."
-It's topical, it's topical.

00:03:52.267 --> 00:03:53.667
