-Is it because I like it, or...

00:04:09.067 --> 00:04:11.968
-Yeah, no one knows.
Everyone's talking.

00:04:11.968 --> 00:04:13.834
-They're talking amongst
themselves.

00:04:13.834 --> 00:04:15.501
-Yeah, they're talking
amongst themselves.

00:04:15.501 --> 00:04:19.300
There's a little kerfuffle
out there.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:21.934
-Okay.
-Can we see the results here?

00:04:21.934 --> 00:04:25.267
Audience says...
-Brunette.

00:04:25.267 --> 00:04:28.434
-I'm going to say this. Yes.

00:04:28.434 --> 00:04:29.767
I'm going to say
the audience is correct,

00:04:29.767 --> 00:04:32.801
