-Uh-huh, that's right.

00:04:36.801 --> 00:04:40.501
Good job, Jimmy.
-But you answered with...

00:04:40.501 --> 00:04:41.501
[ Drum roll ]
-What?

00:04:41.501 --> 00:04:43.634
-Whoa!
[ Bell ringing ]

00:04:43.634 --> 00:04:45.434
-Ice cream!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:45.434 --> 00:04:48.634
-[ Laugh evilly ]

00:04:48.634 --> 00:04:51.200
-Alright, we have
two more questions left.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:54.334
If we get this wrong,
we're deducting three points.

00:04:54.334 --> 00:04:56.501
-Ugh!
-Those are the rules.

00:04:56.501 --> 00:04:58.133
I don't write the rules.
-You don't make them up.

00:04:58.133 --> 00:05:00.100
-No, they've been around NBC --
For 60 years,

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:01.267
