-Yeah.

00:05:01.267 --> 00:05:02.734
-We're not going to
change the rules tonight.

00:05:02.734 --> 00:05:04.167
-No, we can't now.
-No, no, no, no.

00:05:04.167 --> 00:05:05.567
-They changed the page uniform.
-Here we go.

00:05:05.567 --> 00:05:09.434
